  "full_text": "Okay, so I'm going to look at battle lines. There's about three different AIs. One, he just stands there. Another one, he runs around randomly. And another one, he goes after you. This is worth about an hour of entertainment. If you press the mouse button, it'll make it either attracted to or repelled from the mouse cursor based on the wheel. The wheel tells the force, and the closer it is, the more force you apply. You'll get the hang of it. So right now, it's repulsive. So I'm repelling my guys. I can change it to attractive. Now I'm attracting my guys. And you get to play around, and it's worth about an hour. Anyway, how about that?",
